---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Commenting guidelines">
  <section class="page-intro shell-reading"><div class="section-kicker">Commenting guidelines</div><h1>Disagree usefully.</h1><p>The comments are here to make the thinking better, not to manufacture agreement.</p></section>
  <section class="shell-reading article-body">
    <p>Use your real name and a valid email address. Your email is private. Anonymous comments are not accepted.</p>
    <p>Challenge the argument, add evidence, share a different experience or point out something I have missed. Useful disagreement is welcome.</p>
    <p>Spam, abuse, impersonation and comments that add nothing except hostility can be removed. New commenters may be moderated before publication.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
